# N2c: the rig at the slop preset's span, 8 pixels, the divides marked ("The slop preset
# divides every eight"). The divide rig: e1m6's corridor from (504,500,242), a linear turn
# from yaw 104 down at 0.778 degrees a second, no status bar, slop at 1920x1080. N2a, N2b,
# N2c and PER4 are the same turn; the film cuts each where its line falls.

map e1m6

duration 40.1
fps 60
size 1920x1080

preset slop
hud off
cvar gamma 0.8
cvar r_perspspan 8

camera path
key 0     504,500,242  0,104.7778  ease linear
key 40.1  504,500,242  0,73.5889

divides on p244 width 1 alpha 1

sound off
events off
